#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:96
msgid ""
"Enabled: Discount applies to the regular price ($100.00 - 20% = $80.00)."
msgstr "有効: 割引は通常価格に適用されます ($100.00 - 20% = $80.00)。"

